        "summary": "Conversation Events",
        "description": "Outcomes that arrive after the run that prepared them has finished.\n\nAn approved action executes in a worker seconds or minutes later. The run's\nown channel has closed by then, so ``action.done`` and ``action.failed``\nland here instead.",
        "operationId": "conversation_events_api_v1_conversations__conversation_id__events_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "conversation_id",
            "in": "path",
